      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "have Decided to have a look at VR Chat to see how i can get involved\nloaded game through Steam, and as soon as I tried to play game I relished\nshit no keyboard setting\nforced to use WASD\nhave never used those keys will playing on a PC\nIf a game omitted that you could set your own keys,\nI usually deleted game and never play it,\nI consider this to be BAD programming on the side of the developer.\n\nAs I realise this game is very new, I will give it a bit of time to fix this problem.\n\nPLEASE let me KNOW when you fix this problem so I can get to play with the VR Chat concept through your interface.\n\nRANX",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
