      "value": "@{5b06e49555c49e65e1c51ad9|full_name}: \nseriously WSAD is such an old method of movement\nit was only initially used when the only games on PC where side scrolling games, where the only games around (A and D)\nthen when games progressed to Up And DOWN movement\ndevelopers thought DUH! lets just use W and S for up and down\n\nI guess your just a NEWBIE to the games world.\nI realised years ago you actually have keys for Up and down, Side to side\nThey are actually called direction keys\nLOOK next to your num, PAD DUDE!!!\nand you don't have to get you finger tangled.\n\nas for why don't i just use VR, Some people cannot afford VR at the moment,\nDoesn't mean i don't want to chat to get Feedback on what other people are using, so when I am ready I have better info on what to buy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
