      "value": "@{5c3ac8cbd45e7a34967e3783|full_name}: uhh...... WASD has been used for literally decades in any kind of game... specifically 3D, because it allows the user to have a bunch of other buttons around the movement buttons for crouching, sprinting, interacting, voice chat, etc.\ncalling this system outdated is rather wierd, since the arrow keys are mainly used for writing, programming, etc. not for gaming anymore.\n-\nI do agree tho, a ingame keyboard remapper would be useful and im fully for it.\n-\nfor the time being... start the game while holding SHIFT to change the key bindings, as others recommended already.\n-\nhave a great day then.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
