      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: Thanks for the reply\nSorry but once you get used to movement keys that actually line up\nnot angled, its hard to go back\n( I Guess its from using joystick FIRST for gaming, Before PC )\n\nAlso there is a whole array of buttons around The Direction keys as well, once you start setting up\nAlso the num. pad is available. (all lined up horizontal and vertically)\n-\n-\nANYWAY tried your BOOT while pressing SHIFT\nYES it brings up a menu for setting keys,\nunfortunately it does not transfer to the PLAYING the game !!\n\nBummer so close but just not there  !!!!\n\nPS I have been round for DECADES as well\n;)",
